# Spec Kit manifest-tracked types. The Specify CLI hashes raw bytes, so with
# core.autocrlf=true a fresh clone would check these out as CRLF and report
# every managed file as locally modified. Measured on GMweb-API and EVE.
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
